Upstream bug: Responses streaming success logs are lost when the
parser's model_construct fallback leaves a dictionary response or usage.

https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/issues/34754

Reuse the existing response object and usage conversion in the shared
sync/async logger.

Removal check: tests/verify_logging.py

